        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): bound one-shot WebClient/write timeouts without Bolt deadline",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`@slack/web-api` defaults `timeout` to `0` (no deadline). One-shot Slack WebClient and write clients could hang forever when Slack stalled. Lookup already defaulted to 30s; web/write did not.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nPrior tip failed CI for two reasons:\n\n1. **Knip** — public `SLACK_*_TIMEOUT_MS` exports with no production callers\n2. **Bolt contamination** — `provider.ts` passes `resolveSlackWebClientOptions()` into `createSlackBoltApp`. A default timeout on that shared resolver gives Bolt's long-lived client a request deadline\n\n**Fix shape (Bolt-safe):**\n- `resolveSlackWebClientOptions` stays **timeout-free** (Bolt / Socket Mode)\n- `createSlackWebClient` applies a private **30s** one-shot deadline\n- `resolveSlackWriteClientOptions` applies a private **60s** write deadline\n- No new public timeout constant exports\n- Whole-path stalled-header proofs in `client.web-api.test.ts`\n\n## User Impact\n\n- One-shot Slack API calls get bounded timeouts\n- Bolt / Socket Mode listener path unchanged\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Head SHA:** `e37190fea8c9cd1bcdf41bbc04e42a28c5bd9632`\n**Base:** `8bf4d388b05dbce93a449fd8bffc621bd12825a2`\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Files / net | 4 files (~+109/-1); 4th file is real Web API hang proof |\n| Unit | client.test 38 passed (Bolt timeout-free + defaults) |\n| Whole-path | client.web-api.test 8 passed including stalled one-shot web + write |\n| Knip (this PR) | no public Slack timeout constant exports |\n\n### L3 runtime transcript (CI Linux runner)\n\nFrom `checks-node-changed` job running `extensions/slack/src/client.web-api.test.ts` on head `3598e863`:\n\n```\n[WARN] web-api:WebClient:1 http request failed timeout of 80ms exceeded\n[slack one-shot web stall proof] host=runnervm3jd5f pid=2540 ts=2026-07-16T16:18:53.516Z timed_out=true elapsed_ms=84 fetch_calls=1 bolt_shared_timeout=undefined\n\n[WARN] web-api:WebClient:2 http request failed timeout of 80ms exceeded\n[slack write stall proof] host=runnervm3jd5f pid=2540 ts=2026-07-16T16:18:53.602Z timed_out=true elapsed_ms=83 fetch_calls=1\n```\n\nNote: `check-dependencies` is currently red on multiple unrelated open PRs due to unused exports in `src/infra/gateway-supervision.ts` / `restart-handoff.ts` on main — not introduced by this Slack diff.\n\n## Review\n\n- Manually reviewed and verified\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n",
